000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. TQ12SUB.
      *C
      *C  09/12/1996     CA YODER
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C    ALSO CORRECTED A PROBLEM WITH HOW DATA WAS DISPLAYED
      *C    TO SCREEN.  DUE TO FAULTY LOGIC, THE LAST RECORD (OR
      *C    ONLY RECORD, IF ONLY 1 QUALIFIED) WOULDN'T BE DISPLAYED.
      *C
      *C  10/01/1996     CA YODER
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO 69-READ-WO-PARTS-FILE-3 TO PREVENT THE
      *C    PROGRAM FROM LOOPING ON THE LAST RECORD IN THE FILE IF
      *C    IT MET THE SEARCH CRITERIA.
      *C
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
000700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
001000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001100 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZINQUIRY-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
001200     SELECT OUT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-OUTFIQ12
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
001300         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
001400         RELATIVE KEY IS ACT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS OF-STATUS.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
001900     SELECT SORT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DISK-SORTFILE.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ACT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PARTS-FILE-3
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1203
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPFD3-STATUS.
001500     SELECT WORK-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-WRKFIQ12
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
001600         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
001700         RELATIVE KEY IS ACT-KEY-2
               FILE STATUS IS WF-STATUS.
002000 DATA DIVISION.
002100 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
