           05  PRINTF-CC                PIC X.
           05  PRINTF-MSG               PIC X(80).
           05  PRINTF-VAL               PIC X(10).
           05  PRINTF-VAL-9 REDEFINES PRINTF-VAL  PIC 9(10).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(41).
006000 SD  SORT-FILE
