006300 01  SORTF.
006400     05  SORT-WO.
006500         10  SORT-WO-1-6          PIC X(6).
006600         10  SORT-WO-7            PIC X.
006700         10  SORT-WO-REST         PIC XXX.
006800     05  SORT-REQ-NO              PIC X(6).
006900     05  SORT-ORIG                PIC X(4).
007000     05  SORT-PO-NO               PIC X(10).
007100     05  SORT-ORDERED             PIC 9(8).
007200     05  SORT-DESCRIPTION         PIC X(80).
007300     05  SORT-RECEIVED            PIC 9(8).
           05  SORT-RCV-DATE-CN.
               15  SORT-RCV-DATE-CC     PIC X(2).
007400         15  SORT-RCV-DATE        PIC X(6).
007500     05  FILLER                   PIC X(8).
       FD  WO-LAST-NUM-USED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WLNUREC.
       01  WLNUREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPMM0800.
       FD  WO-PARTS-FILE-3
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFD3REC.
       01  WPFD3REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1203.
003900 FD  WORK-FILE
004000     RECORD CONTAINS 142 CHARACTERS
004100     DATA RECORD IS WORKF.
004200 01  WORKF.
           05  WORK-DATA.
004300         10  WORK-WO.
004400             15  WORK-WO-7.
004500                 20  WORK-WO-1-6  PIC X(6).
004600                 20  WORK-WO-YR   PIC X.
004700             15  WORK-WO-REST     PIC XXX.
004800         10  WORK-REQ-NO          PIC X(6).
004900         10  WORK-ORIG            PIC X(4).
005000         10  WORK-PO-NO           PIC X(10).
005100         10  WORK-ORDERED         PIC 9(8).
005200         10  WORK-DESCRIPTION     PIC X(80).
005300         10  WORK-RECEIVED        PIC 9(8).
               10  WORK-RCV-DATE-CN.
                   15  WORK-RCV-DATE-CC PIC X(2).
005400             15  WORK-RCV-DATE    PIC X(6).
005500         10  FILLER               PIC X(8).
