       01  FILE-STATUSES.
           05  DSPLY-STATUS             PIC XX.
           05  OF-STATUS                PIC XX.
           05  WLNU-STATUS              PIC XX.
           05  WPFD3-STATUS             PIC XX.
           05  WF-STATUS                PIC XX.
013000 01  H1.
