013300         VALUE "RECEIVED MATERIAL FOR ".
013400     05  H1-ORIG                  PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
013500     05  FILLER                   PIC X(21) VALUE SPACES.
013600     05  H1-DATE                  PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
013700     05  FILLER                   PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
