018500             15  OUTPUT-LINE-1.
018600                 20  FILLER           PIC X.
018700                 20  OUTPUT-WO        PIC X(10).
018800                 20  FILLER           PIC X(4).
018900                 20  OUTPUT-REQ-NO    PIC X(6).
019000                 20  FILLER           PIC X(4).
019100                 20  OUTPUT-PO-NO     PIC X(10).
019200                 20  FILLER           PIC X(4).
019300                 20  OUTPUT-ORDERED   PIC ZZZZZ.
019400                 20  FILLER           PIC X(4).
019500                 20  OUTPUT-RECEIVED  PIC ZZZZZ.
019600                 20  FILLER           PIC X(4).
019700                 20  OUTPUT-RCV-DATE  PIC X(8).
